      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s the another solution for: b/202832397 - if we don\u0027t want to set device to null and them be visible as such in audio framework, I had to make switching devices from settings work somehow, hence this change. I asked about this particular solution on offline chat and you agreed. \n\nAgain when the wired device is connected and playing audio and a bluetooth device is connected, not playing - just connected - triggering a change of audio route from wired to bt was impossible from BLuetooth Settings. We triggered setActive for a device - a profile saw that it\u0027s already active and returned - nothing else happend. \n\nLet me know if you have another solution for that, I thought it is ok as I proposed it",
